<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93221" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σανδᾰράκ-η</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ρᾰ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>red sulphide of arsenic, realgar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				604b28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				34.177
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
				49
			</span></i>; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σανδαράχη</span></b> 
			in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i> (but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σανδᾰράκ-κη</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Superf.</u>
				32
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.105
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).834
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.33
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>an orange pigment</i> made therefrom, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>. (Assyr. <i>šindu ar[kudot ]u</i> 'green
			paint', i.e. <i>yellow sulphide of arsenic</i>, 
			<i>orpiment</i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρσενικόν</span>.)
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bee-bread</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				626a7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
